==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|it|fo}} {{m|it|pizza}}, of uncertain origin, perhaps from {{etyl|gkm|fo}} {{m|grc|πίττα||cake, pie}}, from {{etyl|grc|fo}} {{m|grc|πίσσα||pitch}}, [[Attic]] {{m|grc|πίττα|}}, from {{m|grc|πεπτός||cooked}} or from {{etyl|lng|fo}} ''pizza'' ("bit, bite"), or from {{etyl|la|fo}} {{m|la|pinso||I beat, pound|sc=polytonic}}.

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|f|pitsu|pitsur}}

# [[pizza]]

